    "details": "The GStreamer project reports:\n\n> Multiple security issues were identified and fixed in the GStreamer\n> framework.\n>\n> - GStreamer-SA-2026-0093: Out-of-bounds read in MXF demuxer\n> - GStreamer-SA-2026-0094: Use of uninitialized memory in H.265\n>   bitstream parser\n> - GStreamer-SA-2026-0095: Out-of-bounds read in H.264 RTP depayloader\n> - GStreamer-SA-2026-0096: Multiple out-of-bounds reads, null pointer\n>   write and denial of service in the VMnc video decoder\n> - GStreamer-SA-2026-0097: Local file disclosure via manifest\n>   references in adaptive streaming (HLS/DASH) demuxers\n> - GStreamer-SA-2026-0098: Out-of-bounds write and infinite loop when\n>   reading responses from a Festival speech synthesis server\n> - GStreamer-SA-2026-0099: Out-of-bounds read when parsing DVB short\n>   event descriptors\n> - GStreamer-SA-2026-0100: Out-of-bounds write in the RTP raw video\n>   depayloader with crafted stream dimensions\n> - GStreamer-SA-2026-0101: Out-of-bounds write in the ASF muxer when\n>   writing metadata with certain Unicode characters\n",
    "id": "FreeBSD-2026-0607",
